      "en": "That is, it is not the children of the flesh who are children of God, but the children of the promise are counted as heirs.",
      "ko": "곧 육신의 자녀가 하나님의 자녀가 아니라 오직 약속의 자녀가 씨로 여기심을 받느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "2da0450390957ba02a692b902e7ece0ae986b443476d69e81df2aff4c5a0a354",
      "translation_text_hash": "7015537b1353912017836f57e3f2facaf801be4dccab6a805f368219d7a52a8d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
